<description>&lt;p&gt;Ecuador is experiencing continued high-profile violence, with authorities summoning seven people to stand trial for plotting to murder a candidate and U.S. prosecutors charging the son of former President and four others with cocaine trafficking. A priest was killed when a crucifix fell from a church wall in the Galapagos, adding a fatal incident to the security crisis. The crisis, which began in 2018, had recorded two battle-related deaths in 2019, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Patch&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMimgFBVV95cUxQUHczLURZd0tVNmk0WGFNVmlzaEk1WGtzSW1SVk5fbXM1dndBalZzOXJLZEdRN2o4clBHTEdqVmZvUFZ0d2hibEJZaDVtZzNVMGZkVm9tSy0wWmd1ZVBWRktSMFc5TGFWejZsMWxXUDhmMDVGOHhEM0RtZjZMcjZJbjV5bldjeDhIdlRLX09yeWZHQTU2bzliMDRB?oc=5&quot;&gt;News-Times&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Devdiscourse&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Fox 59&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiX0FVX3lxTE44M3ZNM2R4anJvMEswM2RsMlNxeFdLbkZaTVBrNTU2X1dPbEJqWk9ZUGc2eXdnRVRBWEhYSzdFbVZpSVhxMjlkQXpHbjBQLXE5UnpJZlMzUVIyM1RxMllZ0gFcQVVfeXFMUDJuTmJ6R1lpd1V3aHgwYThJYjVyVWNZNzNneG83ZFhCdTlaM3hhdHZWWXl6RGZpLVhsSW1qTVRmd2FDTkY4c2RoczliTTZGQVEyY1JMdEt3cnZqQ1E?oc=5&quot;&gt;Modern Ghana&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</description>
